om 20139 and the guide (inferred).\n\n**Description (locale 20139):** \"Pappy Farnum wants to have some old friends over for a BBQ, but since their mailbox was stolen by hooligans, he's not sure his friends will get the invitation. Deliver the invitations personally.\"\n\n**Objective (locale 20206):** \"Deliver the BBQ invitations to Pappy Farnum's guests.\"\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Talk to Pappy Farnum at the farm and accept the offer (20211, 20212).\n2. Deliver the BBQ invitations to Pappy's guests (20206). The guest NPCs, the number of invitations and the delivery targ",
