 "giver_dossier": "# Quests of Mae Farnum (Farnum Farmstead)\n\n## Result: every quest Mae Farnum gives is already built\n\nNo new dossier. The two ids in the record's `quest_ids_given` are both in `quests/*.json`, and the other Mae lines are either reminders for those quests or belong to someone else.\n\n### Already built\n\n| Quest (client title) | Locale title id | Built as | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Second Helping of Strongarm Stew | 1147754359 / 3850568076 (ucdt) | `3000015` in `quests/adventurer.json` (lines 1122-1212), giver `9000000396`, prerequisite `3000006`, `enabled: false` | `quests/adventurer.json:1177` cites Adventurer.md Part B row B1. Intro text id `5100478` resolves in the locale tool: \"You did such a good job the last time you helped me prepare a meal… Would you mind cooking up a second helping of Strongarm Stew for us?\" |\n| Farming 101 | 356185336 (ucdt); locale `4420053` \"Farming 101\" | `3050005` in `quests/chef.json` (lines 268-300), giver `9000000396`, `enabled: true`. Also built as `3000006` in `quests/adventurer.json` (lines 343+), title id `4420053` | `quests/chef.json:278` (Chef.md row E5); `quests/adventurer.json:430` (Adventurer.md row A6) |\n\n### Lines from the record that are not a separate unbuilt quest\n\n- **\"Have you finished helping out Mae Farnum with getting the food ready?\"** (2942446220). This is a reminder line for Second Helping, not a quest. Its locale lookup returns \"no such id\" in the `locale` tool, though the id appears in `refs` (`FreeRealmsLocaleTools/test/FreeRealmsLocaleTools.Tests/data/en_us_data.dat:77625`).\n- **\"Pappy tells me we need to help you prepare supplies now. Let's start with some food…\"** The record cites id `273686373`, which the `locale` tool does not know. The matching text is locale **5100059**: \"Thanks for the help with those fires! Pappy tells me we need to help you prepare supplies now. Let's start with some food. If you're going to cook you may as well look the part!\" That is Pappy's thanks after the fire task, not a Mae line. It leads into Farming 101, so it is not hers.\n- **\"Mae tells me we need to get you some equipment!\"** (1096004507) is Cleetus' Gear Up! line, per the Farnum guide, not a Mae quest.\n- **\"Cook a 2nd helping of Strongarm Stew for Mae Farnum\"** (3223149471) is the Second Helping objective, already in `3000015`. The `locale` tool does not resolve this id, but `refs` `en_us_data.dat:85145` has it.\n\n### Gaps\n\n- Mae's quests are built, so no new objective, reward or prerequisite evidence was add",
