 "giver_dossier": "# Quests of Cleetus Farnum (Farnum Farmstead)\n\n## Result: no unbuilt quests for Cleetus Farnum (npc_id 9000000050)\n\nEvery quest this character gives is already built as a record in `prototype/osfr-tools/data/content/quests/adventurer.json`, with `giver_npc_id` 9000000050. I did not write a new dossier, because the rule is at most four unbuilt quests and there are none.\n\n| Quest | Built id | Title locale id (checked) | Built record |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Gear Up! | 3000007 | 4420058 = \"Gear Up!\" | adventurer.json:473 |\n| Your First Weapon | 3000008 | 4420066 = \"Your First Weapon\" | adventurer.json:577 |\n| Fighting the Pack | 3000009 | 4420074 = \"Fighting the Pack\" | adventurer.json:681 |\n| Cleetus' Copper Collection | 3000016 | 5100483 = \"Cleetus' Copper Collection\" | adventurer.json:1214 |\n| Forging for Reinforcements | 3000017 | 5100487 = \"Forging for Reinforcements\" | adventurer.json:1311 |\n\nThe job-side guide agrees with the built titles. See `notes/Build Guides/Content/Jobs/Adventurer.md` rows A7, A8, A9, B2 and B3 (lines 72-74, 90-91), and `notes/Build Guides/Content/NPCs/NPCs - Farnum Farmstead.md` lines 127-134.\n\n### Gaps and inconsistencies\n\n- **The NPC record is stale.** `npcs/farnum_farmstead.json` has `quest_ids_given` [3000007, 3000009, 3000016]. It omits 3000008 (Your First Weapon) and 3000017 (Forging for Reinforcements), and its `quests_given` entries for 3000009 and 3000016 are bare ids. Those two quests are fully defined in `quests/adventurer.json`. A builder should update the NPC record, not the quest data.\n- **The record's `quests_given_text` names \"Your First Weapon\" with the wiki's 16 coins, but the built file's coin count is also 16.** Its `prerequisite_quest_ids` is [] for 3000009 and [3000008] for 3000017. The built 3000007 prerequisite is 3000006, which is not a Cleetus quest.\n- **Gear Up! ↔ wiki \"Learn to Mine & Smelt Ore\".** The wiki's Your First Weapon requires \"Learn to Mine & Smelt Ore\", and that title is not in the client (`notes/Build Guides/Content/Jobs/Miner.md:178`). The guide treats it as the Gear Up! step. This is unproven and is not a separate quest to build.\n- **Reminder text 1727271980** (\"Have you finished doing what Cleetus has asked you to do?\") is a dialogue line, not a quest. I found no quest record for it.\n- **Reward and text evidence.** Only Your First Weapon (16 coins) and Fighting the Pack (18 coins, from the wiki) have evidenced coin rewards. The built file gives Fighting the Pack rewards that I did not re-c",
