tty\", 2434367310). The quest is not built in `quests/fisherman.json`, but it belongs to Big J's NPC record, not Smitty's.\n- **Fisherman: Buried Treasure** (client 3896600965 / 1642535845). Per `Fisherman.md:142`, the giver is Ernest. Smitty only opens the chest (\"take that treasure chest to Smitty\", 1714672652). This also belongs to Ernest's record.\n\n### Other Smitty-adjacent candidates, all rejected as unevidenced\n\n- **Lakeshore work-order chain** (`Blacksmith.md:402`; locale 2477140188 \"Business is picking up for Smitty...\"; 1022782725 \"",
