r to catch me playing again.\"\n- **Steps (inferred):** talk to Dominic at the Briarwood dig site, then play card games with him. No deck or count is evidenced for this quest.\n- **Prerequisites (R):** Dominic's New Card (3040030), Ambrose's cards are the \"new ones\". The guide only says \"unknown\" for the prerequisite.\n- **Rewards:** unknown. None evidenced.\n- **Evidence:** locale 413778–413781 (the quest-line block, ids in order). Title 413779 also appears in the client locale dumps (`refs`: `opening-*/locale/en_us_data.dat`, \"423274255 ugdt / 7",
