  "locale:407028 [quest_dialog | Briarwood | Dominic's New Card] \"Oh, I have to get back to work. The person I was waiting for is here now. <BR><BR>I know, <font color='#d9781A'>go challenge Dominic</font> to a game. Tell him \"",
