  "locale:413773 [quest_dialog | Briarwood | Card Duelist: Alleged Thievery] \"I need to switch up these cards. You're going to run this dig dry!<BR><BR>Let me fix my deck quick. Can you <font color='#d9781A'>talk</font> to <font color='#d\"",
  "locale:413774 [quest_dialog | Briarwood | Card Duelist: Alleged Thievery] \"Wellington sure makes friends fast. One card game and you're in on the big find, huh? Well, if you're up to no good, Dominic will take care of you.<BR><BR>In an\"",
  "locale:413775 [quest_title | Briarwood | Card Duelist: Break Time] 'Card Duelist: Break Time'",
  "locale:413776 [quest_objective | Briarwood | Card Duelist: Break Time] 'Play a few games of cards with Esther in Briarwood while you wait for Dominic to return.'",
