  "locale:413778 [quest_dialog | Briarwood | Card Duelist: Break Time] \"So I started talking to Ambrose, and he must've noticed my deck of cards. He gave me a bunch of new ones to try out!<BR><BR>I can't wait to see how they do! Are\"",
