  "locale:413781 [quest_dialog | Briarwood | Card Duelist: Gifted Cards] \"You're a flippin' cardie genius! Man, I need to learn how to play like you.<BR><BR>Shh... Did Esther look this way? I don't want her to catch me playing again.\"",
  "locale:413782 [quest_dialog | Briarwood | Card Duelist: Gifted Cards] \"Whew, she's not looking... I swear laser beams were coming out of her eyes last time she found me playing on the job! <font size='11'>Let's keep it quiet...</fo\"",
