  "locale:413797 [quest_dialog | - | Card Duelist: Scattered Artifacts] \"What's your business here? This is private property.<BR><BR>&quot;Shard,&quot; you say? Why should I answer your questions? Hmph, I'll tell you what...<BR><BR>I\"",
