 "giver_dossier": "# Quests of Waterwings (Lakeshore)\n\n## Waterwings (npc 9000000233, Lakeshore): quest dossier\n\nThree quest lines are tied to this NPC. One is already in `quests/fisherman.json`, one is unbuilt and Waterwings-given, and one is a Glerga order that Waterwings only receives.\n\n### 1. Feed the Ducks (unbuilt, Waterwings-given): the main dossier\n\n**Title:** locale **73289** \"Feed the Ducks\". Dat hash 2876341520 (ucdt), with ugdt 3982777117 \"Feed the Ducks\". Guide: `notes/Build Guides/Content/NPCs/NPCs - Lakeshore.md:127` lists it with title ids 1885782413 and 2876341520 and calls it a minigame label.\n\n**Giver:** Waterwings, npc 9000000233 (`npcs/lakeshore.json`, record above). Location: streets of Lakeshore (NPC guide line 127).\n\n**Intro / offer:**\n- 74619 \"Waterwings wants you to fend off some ducks by feeding them his hot pepper fish bait.\" (dat 281790141). Best candidate for the offer line.\n- 73290 (description): \"A gaggle of hungry ducks are roaming the streets of Lakeshore. Clear them out for Waterwings by feeding them some of his ultra-spicy spiralmint fishing bait. Watch out for Hanzo the dog. He'll protect his web footed friends!\" (dat 2221701655).\n- Which of the two is the speech and which the journal description is not confirmed.\n\n**Steps, in order (inferred from objective labels):**\n1. Accept from Waterwings (no separate accept line found).\n2. Feed the ducks with hot-pepper / spiralmint fishing bait. Objective and action lines:\n   - 1660316680 \"Click on a duck to feed them some of Waterwing's spicy spiralmint fishing bait.\"\n   - 1430505917 \"Interact with a duck to feed them some of Waterwing's spicy spiralmint fishing bait.\"\n   - 73449 \"Feed the Ducks!\" (dat 1885782413)\n   - 74624 \"Feed the ducks!\" (dat 1277040809)\n   - 117086 \"Feed the ducks Waterwings' hot pepper fish bait! \" (dat 397298356)\n   - 73457 \"Feed more ducks!\" (dat 195643455)\n   - 388242 \"Feed even more Ducks!\" (dat 120673684)\n   - 73458 \"Feed another group of ducks before time runs out.\" (dat 231465280)\n   - The \"more / even more / another group\" wording suggests waves. Counts and the number of waves are unknown.\n3. Hanzo the dog guards the ducks (73671 \"Hanzo\"; dat 2310062995). Hazard only; no mechanic is evidenced.\n4. Return to Waterwings:\n   - 73453 \"Return to Waterwings\" (dat 3937849930)\n   - 73454 \"Head back to Waterwings and click on him before time runs out.\" (dat 243981147)\n   - 431034 \"Head back to Waterwings and Interact with him before time runs out.\" (dat 3195824311)\n   - 74627",
