  "locale:394671 [quest_title | Seaside | Kart Driver: Frost Ridge Endurance Challenge] 'Kart Driver: Frost Ridge Endurance Challenge'",
  "locale:394672 [quest_objective | Seaside | Kart Driver: Frost Ridge Endurance Challenge] \"Petal's next challenge requires you to keep up the pace around multiple laps at Frost Ridge Speedway!\"",
  "locale:394673 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Kart Driver: The Price of Fame] 'Great job! I could tell you were going to work out. Just one last challenge to go.'",
  "locale:394674 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Kart Driver: The Price of Fame] \"The toughest challenge comes back to making sure you're the best racer at Frost Ridge.<BR><BR>I want you to <font color='#d9781a'>take first</font> place <font \"",
  "locale:394676 [quest_objective | Seaside | Kart Driver: The Price of Fame] \"To win the Seaside Board of Tourism sponsorship, you'll need to win a few races against the toughest competition at Frost Ridge Speedway.\"",
  "locale:394677 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Kart Driver: The Price of Fame] \"You've got yourself a new sponsor, [*player*]!\"",
  "locale:394678 [quest_objective | Seaside | Roxy] \"As your first responsibility, I need you to find <font color='#d9781a'>Roxy</font> in <font color='#d9781a'>Seaside</font>. She's set up an autograph signing fo\"",
  "locale:394679 [quest_title | Seaside | Kart Driver: The Price of Fame] 'Kart Driver: The Price of Fame'",
  "locale:394680 [quest_objective | Seaside | Roxy] 'As part of your sponsorship deal with the Seaside Board of Tourism, you have an autograph signing to attend in Seaside. Find Roxy to get the event started.'",
  "locale:394681 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Ace O'Mally] \"You here for an autograph? An old racing story? Ah! You're the one I'm supposed to race against!<BR><BR>Listen kid, I've been around the block with this kart ra\"",
  "locale:394685 [quest_dialog | Seaside | Ace O'Mally] \"To hear your sponsors talk, you're supposed to be the next Kade Carmichael! Well don't buy into your own hype, it'll make you soft. <font size='11'>That's what \"",
  "locale:394687 [quest_objective | Thunder Falls Speedway | Ace O'Mally] \"You've got a race at Thunder Falls Speedway against a former champion racer, Ace O'Mally. He may be past his prime, but any former champion should prove to be a\"",
  "locale:394688 [quest_reward | Seaside | Kart Driver: The Price of Fame] \"That was some nice driving kid. I've seen a lot of racers come up in my day, and if you keep working at it, tune up your kart a bit, you just might be able to l\"",
  "locale:394691 [quest_dialog | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: A Helping Hand] \"Ugg. It looks like <font color='#d9781a'>Linx</font> just showed up. That kid has some talent for racing, but he's a real bad egg.<BR><BR>I hear there's a bit o\"",
  "locale:394692 [quest_title | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: A Helping Hand] 'Kart Driver: A Helping Hand'",
  "locale:394693 [quest_objective | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: A Helping Hand] \"Linx has arrived at Thunder Falls! It looks like he's followed you again. Ace is concerned that he might be up to no good and wants you to go check on him.\"",
  "locale:394694 [quest_dialog | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: A Helping Hand] \"You got my parts! Awesome! Let me just take those from you...<BR><BR>Oh, you can keep these slick tires. I bought better ones with some <font color='#d9781a'>St\"",
  "locale:394697 [quest_dialog | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: Making Amends] \"I think it's time I let you in on a little secret...<BR><BR>I made it all up! You just stole Chase Wheeler's high end parts for me! Hahaha!<BR><BR>The only way \"",
  "locale:394699 [quest_objective | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: Making Amends] \"Linx Redline's guise of remorse was short-lived, and his lie has gotten you involved in his underhanded plot! It's time to settle the score with Linx on the tra\"",
  "locale:394700 [quest_dialog | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: Making Amends] \"It takes a lot of guts to come tell me all that... but you got tricked into it. That's Linx's bad, not yours. No worries, chief.<BR><BR>But I do still need thos\"",
  "locale:394701 [quest_dialog | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: Making Amends] \"I figure if you were able to steal them from me, you should be able to <font color='#d9781a'>steal my parts back</font> from Linx.<BR><BR>You'll need to find wh\"",
  "locale:394702 [quest_title | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: Making Amends] 'Kart Driver: Making Amends'",
  "locale:394703 [quest_objective | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: Making Amends] \"In order to make things right with Chase Wheeler, you'll need to get back his stolen parts from Linx Redline. Search the area around Thunder Falls Speedway for \"",
  "locale:394704 [quest_dialog | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: Making Amends] \"I knew you'd be able to pull it off! Thanks for getting my stuff back.\"",
  "locale:394705 [quest_dialog | Thunder Falls | Chase Wheeler] \"I suppose now that my ride's back in action you want to see if you can outrace me and increase your ranking. I'm game, but I don't think it will be as easy as t\"",
  "locale:394707 [quest_objective | Thunder Falls | Chase Wheeler] \"Chase Wheeler is the next opponent you'll have to face at Thunder Falls. He's well respected, and a victory over him should go a long way towards setting you up\"",
  "locale:394708 [quest_dialog | Thunder Falls | Chase Wheeler] \"You've had quite a run! You stole my parts, recovered them for me, and then out-raced me!<BR><BR>I may have lost, but at the very least, today's been interestin\"",
  "locale:394709 [quest_dialog | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: Sweetwater Sasparilla Sponsorship] \"Unlike Linx, I don't have any sour grapes after a loss. I think you've got what it takes to go the distance if you keep at it, but you'll need another sponsor b\"",
  "locale:394710 [quest_title | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: Sweetwater Sasparilla Sponsorship] 'Kart Driver: Sweetwater Sasparilla Sponsorship'",
  "locale:394711 [quest_objective | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: Sweetwater Sasparilla Sponsorship] \"It's time to land a new sponsor! Chase has informed you that Shooblemoot at Thunder Falls represents a pretty famous brand: the one and only Sweetwater Sasparil\"",
  "locale:394712 [quest_dialog | Thunder Falls | Kart Driver: Sweetwater Sasparilla Sponsorship] \"[*player*]! I was hoping we'd run into each other. I represent the Sweetwater Brewery, makers of Sweetwater Sasparilla!<BR><BR>I'm here to see about getting a r\"",
  "locale:394713 [npc_name | - | Narbo Amar] 'Narbo Amar'",
  "locale:394714 [quest_dialog | Frost Ridge Speedway | Narbo Amar] \"Head inside the speedway. I've got a few quick checks to run on my kart, but I'll meet you on the track for our race.\"",
  "locale:394716 [quest_dialog | Frost Ridge Speedway | Sparks Blitzwing] 'Even on a treacherous track like Frost Ridge Speedway, [*player*] was able to outrace Sparks Blitzwing!'",
  "locale:394718 [quest_objective | Frost Ridge Speedway | Sparks Blitzwing] 'Beat Sparks Blitzwing in a race at the Frost Ridge Speedway.'",
