hem is the Runalug talk. The Runalug line is not in the guide's row 29 at all;\n   - locale 141828 (\"I just received word that Wugachug was hit by the PCA again. Go talk to Postchug Runalug...\") is the Enve LeStamp Sasparilla-row line (guide row 16, `Postman.md:100`). The test `npc_greetings_enabled_quests.rs:285` notes that the \"split Trail of Mail intro 141828\" has a contested speaker.\n   - Locale 141836 \"Investigate the recent attack on Wugachug.\" is in the same block, so the Wugachug attack appears to be a shared thread. Which string is t",
