  "locale:414930 [quest_dialog | - | Soccer Star: The Perfect Mascot] 'Speaking of fame, what our team needs is a mascot!<BR><BR>It should be a fun, lovable animal that will get everyone excited about our games. Want to help <font '",
  "locale:414931 [quest_title | - | Soccer Star: The Perfect Mascot] 'Soccer Star: The Perfect Mascot'",
  "locale:414932 [quest_dialog | - | Soccer Star: The Perfect Mascot] ' Coach &quot;Golden Leg&quot; Eddie thinks that a team mascot would surely draw more attention to the team. He wants you to help pick out the best mascot for th'",
  "locale:414933 [quest_dialog | - | Soccer Star: The Perfect Mascot] \"Aww... He's perfect! <BR><BR>We shall name him Kicky!\"",
  "locale:414934 [quest_dialog | - | Soccer Star: Power Game] \"So kiddo, those Goalbusters just won't give up! They want to play another game.<BR><BR>We gotta be strong on the offense this time. <font color='#D9781A'>Steal \"",
  "locale:414935 [quest_title | - | Soccer Star: Power Game] 'Soccer Star: Power Game'",
  "locale:414936 [quest_objective | - | Soccer Star: Power Game] 'Coach &quot;Golden Leg&quot; Eddie wants you to play another game against the Goalbusters. Play offensively, and steal the ball as many times as you can!'",
  "locale:414937 [quest_dialog | Briarwood | Black Widows' Rematch] \"Nicely done, kiddo! You're living up to that nickname of yours!<BR><BR>Those Briarwood Black Widows move like they have eight legs. You best get some more pract\"",
  "locale:414938 [quest_dialog | Briarwood | Black Widows' Rematch] \"The Black Widows aren't taking that loss very well. They've bumped up their game and demand a rematch! <BR><BR>Why don't we <font color='#D9781A'>beat</font> th\"",
  "locale:414939 [quest_title | - | Soccer Star: Black Widows' Rematch] \"Soccer Star: Black Widows' Rematch\"",
  "locale:414940 [quest_objective | - | Soccer Star: Black Widows' Rematch] \"The Black Widows aren't taking the loss very well. They want a rematch. Coach &quot;Golden Leg&quot; Eddie has reserved the field for a rematch against the Blac\"",
  "locale:414941 [quest_dialog | - | Soccer Star: Black Widows' Rematch] 'Great game! <BR><BR>I wish we could celebrate, but Manager Landon just told me some terrible news...'",
  "locale:414942 [quest_dialog | - | Soccer Star: Trophy Detective] \"The tournament trophy's been stolen! <BR><BR>Obviously, there's a team out there that wants the trophy, but won't play fair for it. Well... they're not going to\"",
  "locale:414943 [quest_title | - | Soccer Star: Trophy Detective] 'Soccer Star: Trophy Detective'",
  "locale:414944 [quest_objective | - | Soccer Star: Trophy Detective] \"While the rematch was taking place, Coach &quot;Golden Leg&quot; Eddie heard the trophy had gone missing! Someone must've stolen it, but who? Help look around t\"",
  "locale:414945 [quest_dialog | - | Soccer Star: Trophy Detective] \"Nice work, [*player*]. <BR><BR>This soccer ball has the Cheetahs' logo on it...\"",
  "locale:414946 [quest_dialog | - | Soccer Star: Mud Hopping] 'Let the games begin! <BR><BR>I want to scope out the Blackspore team, so I scheduled a scrimmage against them.  Whoever wins gets this sack of coins here. *grin'",
  "locale:414947 [quest_title | - | Soccer Star: Mud Hopping] 'Soccer Star: Mud Hopping'",
  "locale:414948 [quest_objective | - | Soccer Star: Mud Hopping] \"Coach &quot;Golden Leg&quot; Eddie hasn't seen enough of those Mud Hoppers to know exactly what their tactics are. He wants you to play a game against them for \"",
  "locale:414949 [quest_dialog | - | Soccer Star: Mud Hopping] \"Nicely done, kiddo! You really wanted that coin didn't ya?<BR><BR>I think I figured out their strategy. The next game should be an easy win!\"",
  "locale:414950 [quest_dialog | - | Soccer Star: Twinkle Toes] \"The finals are just around the corner! Let's <font color='#D9781A'>scrimmage</font> against the <font color='#D9781A'>Twinkletoes</font> to prepare us for the g\"",
  "locale:414951 [quest_title | - | Soccer Star: Twinkle Toes] 'Soccer Star: Twinkle Toes'",
  "locale:414952 [quest_objective | - | Soccer Star: Twinkle Toes] \"The finals are just around the corner. In order to make sure you're fully prepared, Coach &quot;Golden Leg&quot; Eddie has scheduled a scrimmage against those T\"",
  "locale:414953 [quest_dialog | - | Soccer Star: Twinkle Toes] \"Kiddo, you're fearless. I give you a task and you complete it with ease! <BR><BR>Hot Shot, let's hope you're prepared for the upcoming games.\"",
  "locale:414954 [quest_dialog | - | Soccer Star: Cheetahs Double Challenge] \"Looks like the <font color='#D9781A'>Cheetahs</font> want us to participate in their <font color='#D9781A'>Double Challenge</font> event. <BR><BR>What do you sa\"",
  "locale:414955 [quest_title | - | Soccer Star: Cheetahs Double Challenge] 'Soccer Star: Cheetahs Double Challenge'",
  "locale:414956 [quest_objective | - | Soccer Star: Cheetahs Double Challenge] 'The Cheetahs have requested that the Sidekicks participate in their Double Challenge. Coach &quot;Golden Leg&quot; Eddie wants you to run them down two times! M'",
  "locale:414957 [quest_dialog | - | Soccer Star: Cheetahs Double Challenge] \"Nice, Hot Shot. That should show them that we mean business!<BR><BR>Meanwhile, we've got another problem on our hands...\"",
  "locale:414958 [quest_dialog | - | Missing Soccer Balls] \"It looks like all our  <font color='#D9781A'>soccer balls</font>  have gone missing. I swore I put them back in that barrel. <BR><BR>Mind helping me <font color\""
